{
    "title": "Legacy Academy \u2013 Learn Success",
    "description": "Level-Up Your Self-Improvement Game and step into greatness with the Legacy Academy app! Our gamified learning solution makes self-improvement as enjoyable as playing your favorite game. \r\n\r\nElevate your personal and professional life with structured courses on productivity, human psychology, love, money, health, and more.\r\n\r\nWe save you the hassle of searching by breaking down complex topics into bite-sized, easy to understand text and audio lessons, hand-crafted by experts.\r\n\r\nComplete mini-games, quizzes and challenges to get rewarded with a cash-back in the form of Legacy Tokens ($LGCT), a real crypto currency with a real value.\r\n\r\nREPROGRAM YOUR MIND\r\n\r\n- Productive Habits: Built on a neuroscientific model, the Legacy method ensures you build and maintain productive learning habits.\r\n\r\n- Mindset Transformation: Discover the power of thoughts, challenge limiting beliefs, and develop a winner\u2019s mindset.\r\n\r\nFOLLOW THE HIGH ACHIEVER\u2018S PATH\r\n\r\n- Expert Insights: Our content is based on the thoughts, findings and methods of the world\u2019s leading experts. Follow in the footsteps of successful entrepreneurs, managers and athletes, adopt their strategies and intergrate them into your day to day life.\r\n\r\nMAKE PROGRESS AND EARN REWARDS\r\n\r\n- Verify Knowledge: Deepen and verify your understanding through quizzes and challenges.\r\n\r\n- Track Progress: Keep track of your achievements and continue to grow one lesson at a time.\r\n\r\nWHY CHOOSE LEGACY ACADEMY?\r\n\r\n- Extensive Content: Access a constantly growing, 400 hours content database consisting of bite-sized text and audio lessons, expertly crafted for your growth.\r\n\r\n- Procrastination Killer: Stay motivated with exciting mini-games and quizzes, collect items, open reward chests, earn XP and climb the leaderboard.\r\n\r\n- Action-Oriented: Use action cards after each lesson to apply your new knowledge immediately.\r\n\r\n- Real Rewards: Earn Legacy tokens ($LGCT), a real cryptocurrency, by succeeding in quizzes and challenges. Transfer tokens to your wallet and sell them if you wish, or save them for several future benefits.\r\n\r\n- Build Habits: Develop productive learning habits with our structured, simplified journey guiding you one lesson at a time.\r\n\r\nThe Legacy Academy is more than just an app \u2013 it\u2019s a commitment to unlocking your full potential. Start your free trial today, climb the leaderboard and become the best version of yourself.\r\n\r\nDISCLAIMER\r\n\r\nThe Legacy Academy is a new app and you might experience a few bugs and content errors which we are constantly fixing. The token transfer feature is currently disabled until the exchange listing. You can already earn tokens and transfer them later if you\u2019re a premium user.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Level-Up Your Self-Improvement Game and step into greatness with the Legacy Academy app! Our gamified learning solution makes self-improvement as enjoyable as playing your favorite game. <br><br>Elevate your personal and professional life with structured courses on productivity, human psychology, love, money, health, and more.<br><br>We save you the hassle of searching by breaking down complex topics into bite-sized, easy to understand text and audio lessons, hand-crafted by experts.<br><br>Complete mini-games, quizzes and challenges to get rewarded with a cash-back in the form of Legacy Tokens ($LGCT), a real crypto currency with a real value.<br><br>REPROGRAM YOUR MIND<br><br>- Productive Habits: Built on a neuroscientific model, the Legacy method ensures you build and maintain productive learning habits.<br><br>- Mindset Transformation: Discover the power of thoughts, challenge limiting beliefs, and develop a winner\u2019s mindset.<br><br>FOLLOW THE HIGH ACHIEVER\u2018S PATH<br><br>- Expert Insights: Our content is based on the thoughts, findings and methods of the world\u2019s leading experts. Follow in the footsteps of successful entrepreneurs, managers and athletes, adopt their strategies and intergrate them into your day to day life.<br><br>MAKE PROGRESS AND EARN REWARDS<br><br>- Verify Knowledge: Deepen and verify your understanding through quizzes and challenges.<br><br>- Track Progress: Keep track of your achievements and continue to grow one lesson at a time.<br><br>WHY CHOOSE LEGACY ACADEMY?<br><br>- Extensive Content: Access a constantly growing, 400 hours content database consisting of bite-sized text and audio lessons, expertly crafted for your growth.<br><br>- Procrastination Killer: Stay motivated with exciting mini-games and quizzes, collect items, open reward chests, earn XP and climb the leaderboard.<br><br>- Action-Oriented: Use action cards after each lesson to apply your new knowledge immediately.<br><br>- Real Rewards: Earn Legacy tokens ($LGCT), a real cryptocurrency, by succeeding in quizzes and challenges. Transfer tokens to your wallet and sell them if you wish, or save them for several future benefits.<br><br>- Build Habits: Develop productive learning habits with our structured, simplified journey guiding you one lesson at a time.<br><br>The Legacy Academy is more than just an app \u2013 it\u2019s a commitment to unlocking your full potential. Start your free trial today, climb the leaderboard and become the best version of yourself.<br><br>DISCLAIMER<br><br>The Legacy Academy is a new app and you might experience a few bugs and content errors which we are constantly fixing. The token transfer feature is currently disabled until the exchange listing. You can already earn tokens and transfer them later if you\u2019re a premium user.",
